{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/708bc3ea02915686d376a2eac646cfc3.avif?t=1762141554\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>A nightmare beyond your wildest dreams...</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on a true story, a darkness creeps into the life of a grieving man, twisting his reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>FORCE RESTART</i></strong>, a first-person psychological survival horror thriller, explore surreal worlds with mind-bending traversal and haunting storytelling to uncover the secrets of the void \u2014 or be lost to it forever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.poster.avif?t=1762141554\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.webm?t=1762141554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fa4c958d1c5fe2132d5c5457084d93ed.mp4?t=1762141554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827730/extras/fb622ab2529732ff08410af421059f1d.avif?t=1762141554\" width=1080 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See For Yourself - </strong>Get up close and personal in a suspenseful, first-person tale that stretches the boundaries of reality with literal twists, turns, and mind-bending traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa